steps.description:
In time order; `at` is seconds from the component start. Without any
`type` step every line types in, one after another, from 0.3 s;
otherwise lines without a `type` step are shown from the start.

over.description:
Intentional layering: the id of a component this one is composited
over (drawn above it). Exempts that pair from `component_overlap`;
every other overlap is still a defect.
